    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Absolutely. Well, we know our farmers and ranchers and members of Farm Bureau are certainly glad to have you in your current position, kind of jumping right into various issues. You know, certainly 2020 has been, I would say an interesting year to say the least, not only in ag policy, but I would say in lawmaking across the board. So from your perspective, I guess we'll kick it off talking just a little bit about the whole pandemic. How do you feel that COVID-19 has impacted lawmaking? I guess what's it like to be a U.S. Senator during a global pandemic?",
